  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I know you folks are working your best over on the Dev team, and with the recent events your showing us what your upto, but once things settle down can we get more regular dev updates and better info on when features are coming. One of the complaints I see a lot of is that updates \"take too long\" and considering the last dev stream and road map was April 2021 were a bit over due when it comes to keeping the user base informed. Even a quarterly or 6month update would be nice as I know this sort of thing can be time consuming. Even a were working on this expect it in x months or soon would appease some of these complaints.",
